{{Documentation/Header}}
The breadcrumb header for a forum thread. It renders '''Forums: Index > ''Board'' > ''Page''''' and files the page into both the named board's category and [[:Category:Forum Posts]].

Place it as the first line of a new forum page.

==Syntax==
{{T|Forumheader|v1=board name}}

==Example==
<pre>{{Forumheader|Departure}}</pre>
…renders the breadcrumb and adds the page to [[:Category:Departure]] and [[:Category:Forum Posts]].

